---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<SiteLayout title="Website Privacy — YAER" path="/privacy/" description="How YAER handles information when you visit yaer.io or contact the company.">
<article class="container legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">YAER</p><h1>Website privacy.</h1><p class="legal-date">Last updated October 4, 2026</p>
<p>This notice explains information handling on yaer.io, the company website operated by YAER.</p>
<h2>Visiting this website</h2><p>This is an informational website. YAER does not add analytics tools, advertising trackers, cookies, account registration, or a contact form to this site.</p>
<p>The website is configured for hosting on GitHub Pages. GitHub may process technical information associated with requests, including IP addresses, to operate and secure its services. GitHub states that it logs visitor IP addresses for security purposes. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a> for its practices.</p>
<h2>Contacting YAER</h2><p>If you email YAER, the company receives your email address and the information you choose to include. This information is used to respond to your inquiry and manage the resulting correspondence. Email service providers may process messages to deliver and store that correspondence. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information that is not needed for your inquiry.</p>
<h2>External websites and PuckPlus</h2><p>External websites have their own privacy practices. PuckPlus is a separate mobile app currently in development. This notice covers the YAER company website; it is not a privacy policy for the PuckPlus application. Product-specific privacy information will be provided separately when the app is made available.</p>
<h2>Your questions</h2><p>To ask about information you have shared with YAER, or request its correction or deletion, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Requests will be considered subject to any applicable legal obligations.</p>
<h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>This page will be updated if the website's practices change. The date above indicates the latest update.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="/">Back to YAER <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
</SiteLayout>
